    // Script sheet
    "Print player sheet":"Imprimir hoja de jugadores", "* Not on the first night.":"* No la primera noche.", "Night order (Storyteller)":"Orden nocturno (Narrador)",
    "First night:":"Primera noche:", "Other nights:":"Otras noches:", "Minion info (7+)":"Información de los Esbirros (7+)", "Demon info + bluffs (7+)":"Información del Demonio + faroles (7+)",
